id: pm-linear-sn60
title: linear sync threw plain Error (no exitCode) → runtime double-invocation
description: "linear sync (and the linear-sync importer) threw plain Error on missing team/key and API errors; pm re-invokes the handler on the unhandled path. Added CommandError mirroring SDK EXIT_CODE; the sync catch now preserves a specific exitCode (missing key=2) instead of flattening to generic. missing-team/key=2, API-failure=1; single invocation."
